The code in this package (org.antarcticgardens.cna.port.esl) is relocated and adapted from ESL (Energy Storage
Library), https://gitlab.com/antarcticgardens/esl (branch 1.21.1, common + fabric modules), for the Fabric 26.1.2
port of Create: New Age. Changes: Mojang mappings, Minecraft 26.1.2, Team Reborn Energy 5.0.0, the Architectury
common/platform split collapsed into the Fabric implementation.

